    sub one-ethiopic by one-ethiopic.medi;
    sub two-ethiopic by two-ethiopic.medi;
    sub three-ethiopic by three-ethiopic.medi;
    sub four-ethiopic by four-ethiopic.medi;
    sub five-ethiopic by five-ethiopic.medi;
    sub six-ethiopic by six-ethiopic.medi;
    sub seven-ethiopic by seven-ethiopic.medi;
